    "Sit astride the long box near the front edge, facing the footbar, legs long down the sides.",
    "Hold the short loops by the hips, arms long.",
    "Breathe out to squeeze the box, round the spine and lift the seat a hair as the arms reach forward and up.",
    "Breathe in to lower with control."
